# Search-tool overrides (ripgrep/ag read this; git does not).
# scratch/ is gitignored (session/agent scripts) but must stay SEARCHABLE —
# rg gives .ignore higher precedence than .gitignore, so this negation
# re-includes it for rg/grep while git keeps ignoring it. The trigram index
# includes scratch/ explicitly (trigram-git.ts) for the same reason.
!scratch/
!scratch/**
# Operator docs: gitignored (private) but must stay searchable + @-mentionable,
# same mechanism as scratch/ above.
!docs/design
!docs/design/**
!docs/plans
!docs/plans/**
!docs/external-pulse
!docs/external-pulse/**
!docs/codex-reviews
!docs/codex-reviews/**
!docs/marketing
!docs/marketing/**
!docs/upstream-bugs
!docs/upstream-bugs/**
!docs/integrations
!docs/integrations/**
!docs/*.md
# SlopCodeBench qualification tooling: gitignored (private for now), searchable.
!evals/slopcodebench
!evals/slopcodebench/**
